          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നിയമസഭ — niyamasabha — \"a legislative assembly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നിയമസഭയിൽ ഇന്ന് വലിയ ചർച്ച നടന്നു. niyamasabhayil innŭ valiya carcca naṭannu. There was a big discussion in the assembly today."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A member of it is നിയമസഭാംഗം."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നിയമസഭ (niyamasabha) is a Malayalam compound built from Sanskrit niyama, \"a fixed law\" (CDIAL 7250), and sabhā, \"an assembly, a hall\" (CDIAL 13167): the assembly that makes laws."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
